abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for the comparative study of three prompt-weight syntaxes
  (SD-native parentheses, ComfyUI numeric weights, NovelAI curly braces) on SDXL.
  It regenerates all 1,890 images, the CLIP-L and DINOv2-large scores, the
  two-way ANOVA and the reported figures.
